  "transcript_paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "Speaker 1 [00:00:05] Welcome to the synthetic festival information session."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 2 [00:00:25] Hello, could you tell me where the opening ceremony is held?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 1 [00:00:40] Certainly, it takes place at the community library."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 2 [00:01:10] And what time does the youth concert start?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 1 [00:01:25] The concert begins at 6.15 pm in the auditorium."
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the end of Section one. You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 3 [00:02:00] Good morning hikers, my name is Alex and I will guide today's mountain excursion."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 3 [00:02:30] Please ensure you carry extra water and wear sturdy hiking boots."
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the end of Section two. You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 1 I cannot find the project review guidelines, David."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 4 [00:04:15] They are available on the student intranet portal."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 1 [00:04:45] Do students prefer formative feedback over peer evaluation?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 4 [00:05:10] Yes, initial survey data showed strong preference for tutor feedback."
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the end of Section three. You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 3 [00:06:00] Today we examine the syntactic evolution of creole languages across the Pacific basin."
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaker 1 [00:07:30] That is the end of Section four. You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    }
  ],
